    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_first_select_01",
      "hash64": "46A11261D8481D4E",
      "text": "我想聊聊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_first_select_02",
      "hash64": "46A11161D8481B9B",
      "text": "彼此彼此！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_first_02",
      "hash64": "5055DA0A700B266A",
      "text": "你想跟我聊聊呀！\\n我可真～是受欢迎呀！[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_first_03",
      "hash64": "5055DB0A700B281D",
      "text": "我啊～正一边感受海风，\\n一边望着对战场发呆，\\r\\n期待看到有趣的对战呢～[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_first_04",
      "hash64": "5055D40A700B1C38",
      "text": "啊，对了，对了，\\n蓝莓图鉴怎么样了？[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_first_05",
      "hash64": "5055D50A700B1DEB",
      "text": "要是收集得差不多了，\\n就给我看看吧～[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_first_06",
      "hash64": "5055D60A700B1F9E",
      "text": "要是完成了图鉴，\\n我会好好奖励你的哦。[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_01",
      "hash64": "11282969A285005C",
      "text": "嗨～[VAR 0x0100(0000)]。[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_02",
      "hash64": "11282C69A2850575",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你在生态巨蛋\\n捉到的宝可梦有……[VAR 0x0202(0001)]种！[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0202",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_03",
      "hash64": "11282B69A28503C2",
      "text": "还差很多啊。\\c\\n不过你才刚开始留学，\\n不着急，不着急～[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_04",
      "hash64": "11282669A284FB43",
      "text": "收集到一些了啊。\\c\\n生态巨蛋有多个区域，\\n不断去冒险吧～[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_05",
      "hash64": "11282569A284F990",
      "text": "收集到不少了啊。\\c\\n宝可梦的种类很丰富吧？\\n巨蛋的空调可费钱啦～[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_06",
      "hash64": "11282869A284FEA9",
      "text": "收集到这么多了啊。\\c\\n都走到这一步了，\\n一定要全部完成才行啊～！[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_07",
      "hash64": "11282769A284FCF6",
      "text": "咦～？果然没错？\\n所有种类都齐了～！[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_08",
      "hash64": "11283269A2850FA7",
      "text": "蓝莓图鉴完成了！\\n太厉害了～！可喜可贺～！[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_09",
      "hash64": "11283169A2850DF4",
      "text": "多亏了[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你，\\n栖息在巨蛋的宝可梦的数据\\r\\n已经集齐了吧？[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_10",
      "hash64": "1124A469A281E886",
      "text": "连蓝莓学园的学生\\n都没人完成过，你太厉害了～[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_11",
      "hash64": "1124A569A281EA39",
      "text": "作为庆祝，送你这个吧。\\n这是相当不错的东西哦。[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_head_01",
      "hash64": "15B67CB8135DCF28",
      "text": "席蓝校长，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]同学，\\n交换留学还算顺利吗？[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_12",
      "hash64": "1124A269A281E520",
      "text": "小韦你来了！\\n其实[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]他她啊～……[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_head_02",
      "hash64": "15B67FB8135DD441",
      "text": "什么！[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_head_03",
      "hash64": "15B67EB8135DD28E",
      "text": "你在蓝莓学园\\n也表现活跃啊。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_13",
      "hash64": "1124A369A281E6D3",
      "text": "呵呵呵……\\n看来我的眼光果然没错。[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_head_04",
      "hash64": "15B681B8135DD7A7",
      "text": "既然席蓝校长\\n也如此有兴致，\\r\\n那我也来送上贺礼吧。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_head_05",
      "hash64": "15B680B8135DD5F4",
      "text": "……对努力上进的学生，\\n我们会颁发奖状以示嘉奖。\\c\\n认证宝可梦图鉴的企业\\n也发来了消息哦。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_head_06",
      "hash64": "15B683B8135DDB0D",
      "text": "我已经帮你设定好，\\n用图鉴App就能随时看到了。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_14",
      "hash64": "1124A869A281EF52",
      "text": "不愧是小韦，\\n一直都这么心灵手巧啊。[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_head_07",
      "hash64": "15B682B8135DD95A",
      "text": "哪里哪里，过奖了……[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_head_08",
      "hash64": "15B675B8135DC343",
      "text": "另外，席蓝校长，我还是觉得\\n在学生面前叫我小韦实在是……[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_15",
      "hash64": "1124A969A281F105",
      "text": "哎呀～[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，相信你在\\n我们学园的寻宝也会大获成功的！[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_33",
      "hash64": "111DBB69A27BF0ED",
      "text": "今后你也要和巨蛋的\\n宝可梦好好相处啊～！[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_head_09",
      "hash64": "15B674B8135DC190",
      "text": "……席蓝校长，\\n抱歉，让我插一句煞风景的话。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_head_10",
      "hash64": "15B2F7B8135AB752",
      "text": "在学生面前叫我小韦这事，\\n差不多该……[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_head_11",
      "hash64": "15B2F8B8135AB905",
      "text": "那个……\\n您在听吗？[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_18",
      "hash64": "1124AC69A281F61E",
      "text": "早上好！你起得真早啊！\\c\\n我自然而然就醒了～\\n一上年纪啊，觉就变少咯。[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_19",
      "hash64": "1124AD69A281F7D1",
      "text": "你好，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n交换留学顺利吗？\\c\\n多多捕捉宝可梦，\\n参加蓝乐活，尽情享受吧！[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_20",
      "hash64": "11213E69A27F055D",
      "text": "这里可以说是\\n眺望夕阳的头等席了吧？\\c\\n单为了这个，在大海正中央\\n建学园也值了啊～[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_21",
      "hash64": "11213D69A27F03AA",
      "text": "晚上好，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n你在晚上也很有活力啊～\\c\\n我是个大叔，\\n差不多该去睡了哦。[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_22",
      "hash64": "11213C69A27F01F7",
      "text": "早上好！\\n今天是雨天哦～\\c\\n不过，就算身上被打湿了，\\n也不知道那是海浪的水雾还是雨水，\\r\\n这算是在蓝莓学园的好处啦。[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_23",
      "hash64": "11213B69A27F0044",
      "text": "你好啊，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n雨还在下啊～\\c\\n虽然也可以\\n给入口加上屋檐……\\c\\n但也有喜欢水的宝可梦，\\n所以我就作罢了！[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_24",
      "hash64": "11213A69A27EFE91",
      "text": "好遗憾！今天\\n似乎看不到夕阳了。\\c\\n那就欣赏一下\\n生态巨蛋空中的人工夕阳吧。[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_25",
      "hash64": "11213969A27EFCDE",
      "text": "晚上好，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n你在雨中也很努力啊～\\c\\n千万别脚下一滑，\\n从栈桥掉到海里去哦～[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_stop",
      "hash64": "B6DF0CE259A1574F",
      "text": "要是完成了蓝莓图鉴，\\n就在图鉴App按[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Ｘ键[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]……\\c\\n加上完成图鉴的标记后\\n拿来给我看一下吧～[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
